fice\",\"TradePMR conference room\",\"creditTo\",\"sponsors\",[],{\"_279\":551,\"_552\":686,\"_554\":687},{\"_279\":551,\"_552\":682,\"_554\":683},{\"_279\":563,\"_564\":681},{\"_279\":551,\"_552\":677,\"_554\":678},{\"_279\":551,\"_552\":665,\"_554\":666},{\"_279\":563,\"_564\":664},{\"_279\":560,\"_554\":660,\"_207\":562},{\"_279\":551,\"_552\":656,\"_554\":657},{\"_279\":551,\"_552\":652,\"_554\":653},{\"_279\":563,\"_564\":651},{\"_279\":551,\"_552\":647,\"_554\":648},{\"_279\":551,\"_552\":643,\"_554\":644},{\"_279\":551,\"_552\":639,\"_554\":640},{\"_279\":551,\"_552\":635,\"_554\":636},{\"_279\":551,\"_552\":631,\"_554\":632},{\"_279\":560,\"_554\":627,\"_207\":562},{\"_279\":551,\"_552\":615,\"_554\":616},{\"_279\":551,\"_552\":595,\"_554\":596},{\"_279\":551,\"_552\":591,\"_554\":592},{\"_279\":551,\"_552\":566,\"_554\":567},{\"_279\":563,\"_564\":565},{\"_279\":560,\"_554\":561,\"_207\":562},{\"_279\":551,\"_552\":553,\"_554\":555},\"paragraph\",\"attrs\",{\"_559\":301},\"content\",[556],{\"_279\":557,\"_557\":558},\"text\",\"As of 12 p.m. ET, Robinhood's stock was up 1.7% in trading on Tuesday.\",\"textAlign\",\"relatedArticle\",[],\"Related\",\"ad\",\"pos\",\"native_2v\",{\"_559\":301},[568,569,570,571,572],{\"_279\":557,\"_557\":590},{\"_279\":557,\"_574\":585,\"_557\":586},{\"_279\":557,\"_557\":584},{\"_279\":557,\"_574\":575,\"_557\":576},{\"_279\":557,\"_557\":573},\" in 2021.\",\"marks\",[577],\"sold the custody business to Axos Financial\",{\"_279\":439,\"_552\":578},{\"_373\":579,\"_580\":581,\"_582\":-5,\"_583\":-5},\"https://www.wealthmanagement.com/industry/morgan-stanley-sells-recently-acquired-etrade-custody-unit-axos\",\"target\",\"_self\",\"rel\",\"class\",\". Morgan Stanley acquired E*Trade, which had an RIA custodial unit, in 2020, but it turned around and \",[587],\"purchased Folio Financial\",{\"_279\":439,\"_552\":588},{\"_373\":589,\"_580\":581,\"_582\":-5,\"_583\":-5},\"https://www.wealthmanagement.com/technology/goldman-sachs-acquire-folio-financial\",\"This is not the first publicly-traded financial services company to try and purchase a foothold in the RIA custody space. In 2020, Goldman Sachs \",{\"_559\":301},[593],{\"_279\":557,\"_557\":594},\"Robinhood used Citi to advise on the transaction, while TradePMR used Lazard Inc. as its financial advisor.\",{\"_559\":301},[597,598,599,600,601],{\"_279\":557,\"_557\":614},{\"_279\":557,\"_574\":609,\"_557\":610},{\"_279\":557,\"_557\":608},{\"_279\":557,\"_574\":603,\"_557\":604},{\"_279\":557,\"_557\":602},\" to settle, without admitting guilt, charges it failed to execute some trades at the best available price and let unqualified investors trade options.\",[605],\"FINRA\",{\"_279\":439,\"_552\":606},{\"_373\":607,\"_580\":581,\"_582\":-5,\"_583\":-5},\"https://www.wealthmanagement.com/regulation-compliance/robinhood-pay-finra-record-70-million-penalty-over-lapses\",\" and \",[611],\"SEC\",{\"_279\":439,\"_552\":612},{\"_373\":613,\"_580\":581,\"_582\":-5,\"_583\":-5},\"https://www.sec.gov/newsroom/press-releases/2020-321\",\"Around the same time, Robinhood paid $135 million collectively to the \",{\"_559\":301},[617,618,619],{\"_279\":557,\"_557\":626},{\"_279\":557,\"_574\":621,\"_557\":622},{\"_279\":557,\"_557\":620},\", claiming the gamification features harmed investors by fueling speculative trading, even though Robinhood had largely removed the features by 2021.\",[623],\"fined the online brokerage firm $7.5 million\",{\"_279\":439,\"_552\":624},{\"_373\":625,\"_580\":581,\"_582\":-5,\"_583\":-5},\"https://www.wealthmanagement.com/regulation-compliance/robinhood-pays-75m-settle-massachusetts-gamification-charge\",\"In addition to equities, clients use Robinhood for trading cryptocurrency and options. The firm was criticized during the pandemic for encouraging what some saw as reckless trading among clients with easy access to margin loans and a “gamified” user experience, including rewards, stock giveaways, virtual confetti drops for trades, games and social media sharing. In January, Massachusetts’ regulators \",[628],{\"_207\":629,\"_167\":630,\"_580\":581},\"Robinhood Acquires AI-Driven Investment-Advice Platform Pluto\",\"/artificial-intelligence/robinhood-acquires-ai-driven-investment-advice-platform-pluto\",{\"_559\":301},[633],{\"_279\":557,\"_557\":634},\"“Robinhood’s great at retail; they’re great at technology. But they’re not in the advisor space,” he said. “So for TradePMR, we’re going to be left alone to continue to grow and do our business and continue to serve advisors.”\",{\"_559\":301},[637],{\"_279\":557,\"_557\":638},\"Baldwin added that Robinhood doesn’t have any overlap with TradePMR’s business.\",{\"_559\":301},[641],{\"_279\":557,\"_557\":642},\"Robinhood said it expects to maintain TradePMR’s long-standing relationship with Wells Fargo Clearing Services, which provides clearing, execution and lending services. Robinhood’s 24 million customers sit on its own self-clearing platform, which it started building in 2018, Baldwin said.\",{\"_559\":301},[645],{\"_279\":557,\"_557\":646},\"“This is the solution,” he said, in an interview with WealthManagement.com. “We’re going to meet that generation where they are. And where they are is on Robinhood.”\",{\"_559\":301},[649],{\"_279\":557,\"_557\":650},\"“For many years, the advisor industry has discussed the issue of losing customers when assets transition to a spouse or to heirs,” Baldwin said in a statement.\",\"video_v\",{\"_559\":301},[654],{\"_279\":557,\"_557\":655},\"The two companies will create a referral program, giving TradePMR’s RIA clients access to Robinhood customers through a joint tech platform. Robinhood investors will also be able to find and connect with TradePMR advisors. Baldwin said he expects that new platform to be rolled out 12 months after the deal closes.\",{\"_559\":301},[658],{\"_279\":557,\"_557\":659},\"“We believe this acquisition is the next step in serving these investors as their needs evolve and mature,” Robinhood said in a statement.\",[661],{\"_207\":662,\"_167\":663,\"_580\":581},\"TradePMR Adds Tech Execs From Schwab, Apex and Goldman Sachs\",\"/financial-technology/tradepmr-adds-tech-execs-from-schwab-apex-and-goldman-sachs\",\"native_1v\",{\"_559\":301},[667,668,669],{\"_279\":557,\"_557\":676},{\"_279\":557,\"_574\":671,\"_557\":672},{\"_279\":557,\"_557\":670},\", has more than 24 million funded customer accounts, the majority of which are millennials and Gen Z investors, with about $160 billion in assets in custody, or around $6,500 per account, on average. Despite the relatively small individual account sizes, Robinhood believes some of its clients will be looking for more sophisticated financial advice as they age.\",[673],\"went public three years ago\",{\"_279\":439,\"_552\":674},{\"_373\":675,\"_580\":581,\"_582\":-5,\"_583\":-5},\"https://www.wealthmanagement.com/technology/robinhood-banks-its-traders-allegiance-ipo-no-other\",\"Robinhood, which \",{\"_559\":301},[679],{\"_279\":557,\"_557\":680},\"The deal marks Robinhood’s entrance into the wealth management space, as it aims to connect its investors with human advisors, according to the company.\",\"300_1v_article\",{\"_559\":301},[684],{\"_279\":557,\"_557\":685},\"The online brokerage firm will pay some $300 million for TradePMR via a mix of cash and stock, with the deal expected to close in the first half of 2025. CEO Robb Baldwin, who founded TradePMR in 1998, and his team will join Robinhood as part of the transaction. TradePMR will maintain its branding, and it will operate as a subsidiary of Robinhood.\",{\"_559\":301},[688],{\"_279\":557,\"_557\":689},\"Robinhood Markets has penned an agreement to acquire TradePMR, the Florida-based technology and custodial services provider for registered investment advisors with over $40 billion in assets under administration across 350 firms.\",{\"_279\":708,\"_167\":709},{\"_279\":706,\"_167\":707},{\"_279\":704,\"_167\":705},{\"_279\":702,\